// Fixture that triggers a compile error: an actor method passes a block that
// assigns a captured local to a `sealed` method of its own class (ADR 0133,
// BT-3902; ADR 0131 §6 exempted this shape until then, BT-3755). Used by
// tests/repl-protocol/cases/adr0133_escaping_block.btscript via
// `// @load-error`.

Actor subclass: Adr0133EscapingBlockErrorFixture

  sealed twice: b =>
    b value
    b value

  run =>
    t := 0
    self twice: [t := t + 1]
    t
